            </note>
            <note corresp="#d244-f2" n="2" xml:id="d244-f2-content">
                <p>The President met with his advisers in the White House Situation Room from 8:57
                    to 11:55 a.m. (Ibid., President’s Daily Diary) Helms also recalled the meeting in an oral history interview.
                    (Interview with Helms, April 4, 1969;
                        Johnson Library) For Thompson’s comments on the Hot Line exchanges,
                    see <ref target="#d245">Document 245</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
